# Use Cases

## UC01 — Due Diligence Financial Review

- **Persona**: PE / corp dev analyst reviewing a target
- **Scenario**: Verify financials, spot red flags, cross-check numbers between annual report, proxy, and Excel model
- **Question types**: numerical calc; cross-doc (10-K vs proxy); Excel step-by-step logic; reasoning on covenants/warning signs
- **What it tests**: numeric extraction + cross-doc consistency + chained reasoning
- **Sample docs**:
    - Microsoft FY24 10-K + proxy
    - Volvo annual 2024
    - Maersk annual 2024
    - SVB last 10-Q
    - Synthesized Excel model deck with planted logic errors

## UC02 — ESG / Sustainability Audit

- **Persona**: sustainability lead prepping CSRD, or auditor
- **Scenario**: extract every Scope 3 category, every material topic, every emissions figure; verify against CSRD/ESRS
- **Question types**: exhaustive search; numerical aggregation; multi-doc cross-reference (report vs framework)
- **What it tests**: long-doc exhaustive extraction + framework alignment
- **Sample docs**:
    - Unilever sustainability report 2024
    - Ørsted sustainability report 2024
    - H&M sustainability report 2024
    - CSRD ESRS standards

## UC03 — Regulatory vs Policy Gap Check

- **Persona**: GRC / internal audit
- **Scenario**: enumerate every obligation in a regulation; assess if internal policy addresses each yes/partial/no with citations on both sides
- **Question types**: cross-doc (reg vs policy); exhaustive requirements enumeration; classification; reasoning on partial coverage
- **What it tests**: cross-doc reasoning + exhaustiveness + citation fidelity
- **Sample docs**:
    - EU AI Act consolidated
    - GDPR
    - NIS2 directive
    - Repo's `ops_security.docx`
    - Repo's `secure_dev_policy.docx`
    - Synthesized policy with planted gaps

## UC04 — Contract Clause Sweep

- **Persona**: legal ops / M&A counsel
- **Scenario**: across a bundle of contracts, find every change-of-control, LoL, IP assignment, termination-for-convenience clause; classify each
- **Question types**: exhaustive (find every X); classification; clause-level citation fidelity
- **What it tests**: exhaustive search across many docs + accurate clause-level citation
- **Sample docs**:
    - 5–10 SEC EDGAR public material contracts
    - Synthesized MSA bundle with planted clauses

## UC05 — Board / Committee Composition Audit

- **Persona**: corporate secretariat
- **Scenario**: identify every board member + committee assignment; reconcile across proxy, governance HTML, scanned meeting minutes
- **Question types**: exhaustive person extraction; cross-doc identity resolution; mixed formats
- **What it tests**: exhaustive person extraction + identity reconciliation across formats
- **Sample docs**:
    - 3 cos' DEF 14A proxy statements
    - Frozen governance HTML
    - Board photo / org-chart PDF
    - Handwritten meeting-minutes scan

## UC06 — Multimodal Evidence Extraction

- **Persona**: advisory / forensic analyst
- **Scenario**: pull facts from scanned old report, whiteboard photo, Excel with chart-as-image, handwritten notes
- **Question types**: OCR-grade text from scans; handwriting recognition; image-only chart interpretation; cross-modal reconciliation
- **What it tests**: format coverage — exposes tools that can't ingest non-text inputs
- **Sample docs**:
    - Scanned 1990s annual report
    - Whiteboard photo
    - Multi-tab Excel with chart-as-image
    - Original handwritten analyst notes
